 "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>K-God Robot Hunters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一款深植于韩国神话的肉鸽卡组构筑游戏。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >五行。150位女神。每一手牌，都将重塑世界。<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/a711c74698b0ee4de35456232bf64506.avif?t=1788570832\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>故事</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当被遗弃的机器人学会感受「爱」，世界便走向崩毁。它们对人类的奉献扭曲成愤怒，城市在机械叛乱的冲击下倾覆。人类濒临灭亡之际，机器人猎人李镇谦发现了一股古老力量——封印于卡牌中的韩国神话女神——并发动人类最后的反抗。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/a3e64b8b29d83fbf1c182a4c3f3c2dcc.avif?t=1788570832\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>前所未有的卡组构筑体验</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >忘掉黑桃和红心吧。K-God Robot Hunters从零开始，以<strong>东方游戏语法</strong>打造。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的卡组由<strong>五种五行花色</strong>驱动——木、火、土、金、水——并拥有源自八卦、阴与阳的十个点数。卡牌点数系统将西方扑克的策略深度与韩国传统纸牌游戏<strong>Badugi</strong>的节奏融为一体。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/7986648ee0b720cc712f4026101e399b.avif?t=1788570832\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras_big/7986648ee0b720cc712f4026101e399b.webp?t=1788570832 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >掌握其他地方找不到的牌型：Deungyongmun、Seonbi、Yangban、Samjeongseung、Osaek、Osaek-chan-yeon、Eoga、Yongmaru、Sabangsin——直至至高牌型：Yongbi。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >洞察阴阳的平衡，释放最大火力。你能达到这一境界吗？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>150张女神卡牌</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一张卡牌都是诞生于韩国与东方神话的女神——但并非你记忆中的模样。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >担任投资银行 CEO 的<strong>九尾狐</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >穿行于地铁车厢、沿途售卖商品的<strong>熊女</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >化身冰雪精灵、在冰面上优雅滑行的<strong>仙女</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/356a003bdc1750b9b850842dc236b582.poster.avif?t=1788570832\" width=1170 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/356a003bdc1750b9b850842dc236b582.webm?t=1788570832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/356a003bdc1750b9b850842dc236b582.mp4?t=1788570832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每位女神都是古老神话与当代韩国生活交汇处的现代重塑。组合她们独特的能力，构筑你的卡组，奋起反击。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>主要特色</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >基于原创五行卡牌系统的扑克肉鸽游戏</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150 多张受韩国与东方神话启发的女神卡牌</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >植根于东方哲学的独特牌型等级系统</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >古老神话与机械叛乱交汇的赛博朋克世界</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >拥有阴阳平衡机制的策略卡组构筑</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/fbecb7dd688791194098433abd7c6673.avif?t=1788570832\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras_big/fbecb7dd688791194098433abd7c6673.webp?t=1788570832 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>早期试玩版 — 我们需要你的反馈！</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是 K-God Robot Hunters 的早期版本。我们正在积极开发游戏，而你的反馈将直接塑造它的未来。试玩 Demo，尽情折腾，然后告诉我们你的想法！</p>",
 "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>K-God Robot Hunters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一款深植于韩国神话的肉鸽卡组构筑游戏。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >五行。150位女神。每一手牌，都将重塑世界。<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/a711c74698b0ee4de35456232bf64506.avif?t=1788570832\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>故事</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当被遗弃的机器人学会感受「爱」，世界便走向崩毁。它们对人类的奉献扭曲成愤怒，城市在机械叛乱的冲击下倾覆。人类濒临灭亡之际，机器人猎人李镇谦发现了一股古老力量——封印于卡牌中的韩国神话女神——并发动人类最后的反抗。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/a3e64b8b29d83fbf1c182a4c3f3c2dcc.avif?t=1788570832\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>前所未有的卡组构筑体验</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >忘掉黑桃和红心吧。K-God Robot Hunters从零开始，以<strong>东方游戏语法</strong>打造。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的卡组由<strong>五种五行花色</strong>驱动——木、火、土、金、水——并拥有源自八卦、阴与阳的十个点数。卡牌点数系统将西方扑克的策略深度与韩国传统纸牌游戏<strong>Badugi</strong>的节奏融为一体。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/7986648ee0b720cc712f4026101e399b.avif?t=1788570832\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras_big/7986648ee0b720cc712f4026101e399b.webp?t=1788570832 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >掌握其他地方找不到的牌型：Deungyongmun、Seonbi、Yangban、Samjeongseung、Osaek、Osaek-chan-yeon、Eoga、Yongmaru、Sabangsin——直至至高牌型：Yongbi。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >洞察阴阳的平衡，释放最大火力。你能达到这一境界吗？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>150张女神卡牌</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一张卡牌都是诞生于韩国与东方神话的女神——但并非你记忆中的模样。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >担任投资银行 CEO 的<strong>九尾狐</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >穿行于地铁车厢、沿途售卖商品的<strong>熊女</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >化身冰雪精灵、在冰面上优雅滑行的<strong>仙女</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/356a003bdc1750b9b850842dc236b582.poster.avif?t=1788570832\" width=1170 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/356a003bdc1750b9b850842dc236b582.webm?t=1788570832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/356a003bdc1750b9b850842dc236b582.mp4?t=1788570832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每位女神都是古老神话与当代韩国生活交汇处的现代重塑。组合她们独特的能力，构筑你的卡组，奋起反击。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>主要特色</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >基于原创五行卡牌系统的扑克肉鸽游戏</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150 多张受韩国与东方神话启发的女神卡牌</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >植根于东方哲学的独特牌型等级系统</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >古老神话与机械叛乱交汇的赛博朋克世界</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >拥有阴阳平衡机制的策略卡组构筑</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/fbecb7dd688791194098433abd7c6673.avif?t=1788570832\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras_big/fbecb7dd688791194098433abd7c6673.webp?t=1788570832 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>早期试玩版 — 我们需要你的反馈！</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是 K-God Robot Hunters 的早期版本。我们正在积极开发游戏，而你的反馈将直接塑造它的未来。试玩 Demo，尽情折腾，然后告诉我们你的想法！</p>",
